WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Design for manufacture. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: Find seams, draft and assembly logic

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: Design for manufacture asks how a shape can be made, joined, inspected and repaired. Attractive geometry still needs a plausible process.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: A deep undercut may complicate a simple forming tool; mark the direction the tool or part must move.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: Constraint audit

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: A view supports interpretation; it cannot prove hidden structure or compliance alone.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: Find seams, draft and assembly logic
